<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-LEHMAN UPGRADES HEINEKEN.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-LEHMAN UPGRADES HEINEKEN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers raised its rating on Heineken to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;outperform&quot;.</p>
<p>The change of stance is based on the view that a double digit rate of growth will begin in the second half of 1997 due to continued U.S. volume growth and a soaring dollar. Comparisons with Europe are also much easier in both weather and provisions, a Lehman Brothers note said.</p>
<p>Lehman said it believed the rate of growth will continue into 1998 and 1999.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
